  "story": {
    "day": 92,
    "title": "Kaya's Museum Day",
    "sentences": [
      "Last Thursday, Kaya and her aunt visited a history museum.",
      "They paid thirty dollars. The fortieth anniversary was this year.",
      "Kaya saw exhibit number twelfth, with old customs and so on.",
      "A hundredth-year-old plate, whose design had a tail, was from the thirteenth century.",
      "It told the story of a thousandth-year-old religious place.",
      "The museum's sixtieth and eightieth artifacts were also special.",
      "The twenty-second of the month marked a museum event.",
      "Later, they found the museum kitchen. A blackboard listed food.",
      "Kaya ordered roast beef and cream. It was ready.",
      "Her aunt got change. They found a seat between two pillars.",
      "Kaya used a small towel. She liked all the different exhibits.",
      "Kaya felt sorry to leave. She was sure to visit again someday for a photo."
    ]
  }
}